second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is the artist of the album \\\"Stranger Things Have Happened\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"artist\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 179, \"text\": \"Stranger Things Have Happened (Justin Guarini album) Stranger Things Have Happened is the second studio album of jazz standards by singer Justin Guarini that was released in 2005.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d00\", \"start\": 180, \"end\": 349, \"text\": \"Stephen Erlewine at AllMusic wrote that this album was the \\\"American Idol\\\" runner-up's attempt to reinvent himself after the failure of the movie \\\"From Justin to Kelly\\\".\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d00\", \"start\": 350, \"end\": 627, \"text\": \"The result is \\\"loungey, \\\"Am-Idol\\\"-styled vocal jazz, but \\\"Stranger Things Have Happened\\\" is vocal jazz all the same...Guarini has genuine, natural charisma as a supper club-styled singer, and that charisma when contrasted with his band's jazz chops has a nice, relaxed appeal.\\\"\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d00\", \"start\": 628, \"end\": 651, \"text\": \"Despite its weaknesses,\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 128, \"text\": \"Stranger Things Have Happened ( Justin Guarini album ) | Celebrities Wiki | Fandom Start a Wiki Sign In Do n't have an account ?\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d01\", \"start\": 129, \"end\": 630, \"text\": \"Register Sign In Celebrities Wiki Explore Main Page Discuss All Pages Community Interactive Maps Recent Blog Posts Wiki Content Recently Changed Pages Josh Hucherson Alan Rickman Josh Hutcherson Martin Lawrence Gabby Barrett Clay Aiken Stranger Things Have Happened ( Justin Guarini album ) Maintenance Templates Candidates for deletion Stubs Unattributed files Hatnote templates with errors Pages with broken file links RCA Records Miss Independent ( Kelly Clarkson song ) Low ( Kelly Clarkson song )\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 274, \"text\": \"Permanent link Page information Cite this page Get shortened URL Download QR code Print/export Download as PDF Printable version In other projects Wikidata item Appearance move to sidebar hide From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Stranger Things Have Happened may refer to:\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02\", \"start\": 275, \"end\": 328, \"text\": \"- Stranger Things Have Happened (Clare Maguire album)\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02\", \"start\": 329, \"end\": 381, \"text\": \"- Stranger Things Have Happened (Dolly Parton album)\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02\", \"start\": 382, \"end\": 432, \"text\": \"- Stranger Things Have Happened (Peter Tork album)\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02\", \"start\": 433, \"end\": 486, \"text\": \"- Stranger Things Have Happened (Ronnie Milsap album)\"}, \"D3S6\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02\", \"start\": 487, \"end\": 545, \"text\": \"- “Stranger Things Have Happened” (song), by Ronnie Milsap\"}, \"D3S7\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02\", \"start\": 546, \"end\": 582, \"text\": \"- “Stranger Things Have Happened,” a\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 169, \"text\": \"Stranger Things Have Happened (Ronnie Milsap album) Stranger Things Have Happened is the nineteenth studio album by country music artist Ronnie Milsap, released in 1989.\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d03\", \"start\": 170, \"end\": 352, \"text\": \"The album produced four singles, two of which claimed the top spot on the Billboard country singles chart, including \\\"A Woman in Love\\\" and \\\"Don't You Ever Get Tired (Of Hurting Me).\\\"\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d03\", \"start\": 353, \"end\": 460, \"text\": \"The other singles, included \\\"Houston Solution\\\" and the title track, which peaked at #4 and #2 respectively.\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d03\", \"start\": 461, \"end\": 597, \"text\": \"Of especial note is the song \\\"You Snap Your Fingers (And I'm Back in Your Hands)\\\", which made an appearance once before in his career on\"}, \"D5S1\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d04\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 166, \"text\": \"notable friends are aboard in addition to his direct collaborator and co-producer, James Lee Stanley—Micky Dolenz, Michael Nesmith, Mackenzie Phillips, and Timothy B.\"}, \"D5S2\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d04\", \"start\": 167, \"end\": 185, \"text\": \"Schmit among them.\"}, \"D5S3\": {\"document_number\": 5, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d04\", \"start\": 186, \"end\": 625, \"text\": \"There are songs drawn from across the spectrum of Tork's career, including a gorgeous, folk-style cover of 'Take a Giant Step' that made this reviewer smile so emphatically it was mixed with tears of joy; the exquisitely funny 'Milkshake', a delightfully wry account of life on the road that includes Nesmith and Dolenz and some of the most charmingly silly choruses ever heard in a legitimate rock song; 'MGB-GT', a very personal car song\"}, \"D6S1\": {\"document_number\": 6, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d05\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 574, \"text\": \"Ben Harris – engineer , track recording , overdub recording , mixing Kyle Lehning – mixing Randy Gardner – assistant engineer , mix assistant Keith Odle – assistant engineer , mix assistant Milan Bogdan – digital editing Glenn Meadows – mastering Masterfonics ( Nashville , Tennessee ) – editing and mastering location Linda Bres – session coordinator Joe Galente – A & R direction Mary Hamilton – art direction , design Jim `` Señor '' McGuire – photography Joyce Milsap – hair , make-up Bev Riedel-Patterson – hair , make-up Chart performance [ edit ] Album [ edit ] Chart\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album \\\"Stranger Things Have Happened\\\"\", \"claim\": \"Justin Guarini is the artist of the album \\\"Stranger Things Have Happened\\\".\", \"answer\": \"Justin Guarini\", \"quote\": \"Stranger Things Have Happened (Justin Guarini album) Stranger Things Have Happened is the second studio album of jazz standards by singer Justin Guarini that was released in 2005.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album\", \"claim\": \"Justin Guarini is the artist of the album \\\"Stranger Things Have Happened\\\".\", \"answer\": \"Justin Guarini\", \"quote\": \"Stranger Things Have Happened ( Justin Guarini album ) | Celebrities Wiki | Fandom Start a Wiki Sign In Do n't have an account ?\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album\", \"claim\": \"Clare Maguire is the artist of the album \\\"Stranger Things Have Happened\\\".\", \"answer\": \"Clare Maguire\", \"quote\": \"- Stranger Things Have Happened (Clare Maguire album)\", \"original_document_number\": 3}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02:c1\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album\", \"claim\": \"Dolly Parton is the artist of the album \\\"Stranger Things Have Happened\\\".\", \"answer\": \"Dolly Parton\", \"quote\": \"- Stranger Things Have Happened (Dolly Parton album)\", \"original_document_number\": 3}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d02:c2\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album\", \"claim\": \"Peter Tork is the artist of the album \\\"Stranger Things Have Happened\\\".\", \"answer\": \"Peter Tork\", \"quote\": \"- Stranger Things Have Happened (Peter Tork album)\", \"original_document_number\": 3}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d03\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0389-60daa4e8238a:d03:c0\", \"entity\": \"artist\", \"scope\": \"album \\\"Stranger Things Have Happened\\\"\", \"claim\": \"Ronnie Milsap is the artist of the album \\\"Stranger Things Have Happened\\\".\", \"answer\": \"Ronnie Milsap\", \"quote\": \"Stranger Things Have Happened (Ronnie Milsap album) Stranger Things Have Happened is the nineteenth studio album by country music artist Ronnie Milsap, released in 1989.\", \"original_document_number\": 4}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Justin Guarini\", \"Clare Maguire\", \"Dolly Parton\", \"Peter Tork\", \"Ronnie Milsap\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Justin Guarini\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Clare Maguire\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Dolly Parton\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C3\", \"answer\": \"Peter Tork\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C4\", \"answer\": \"Ronnie Milsap\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
